                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Forcing a 4-year-old U.S. citizen with Stage 4 cancer to be deported with his mother and sister tears him from his doctors, his treatment, and his rights.\n\nThis isn\u2019t border security \u2014 it\u2019s cruelty.\n\nAmerican children shouldn\u2019t be casualties of a secure border.",
